Package: taskr
Title: Background Tasks and Scheduling for R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Chenyu",
           family = "Li",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "chenyu.li.hz@gmail.com")
Description: Run long R tasks in background processes and manage them through
    a simple in-memory queue. The package supports explicit task submission,
    progress reporting, and lightweight scheduling without relying on any
    specific IDE or application domain.
